      "stem": "A student improves the burette contribution from 0.4 to 0.2 percent. What does the worked example's total become?",
      "misconceptionClass": "improvement application",
      "kind": "application",
      "modelAnswer": "Replacing the burette's 0.4 with 0.2 drops the four-way sum to 1.0 percent.",
